Open Charge Map is a non-profit, community project. This community
integration is not affiliated with, endorsed or sponsored by Open Charge Map.
It reads the Open Charge Map API (api.openchargemap.io) with the API key of
each user, under the terms of https://openchargemap.org/about/terms.

Charging station data: Open Charge Map Contributors, licensed under the
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC BY 4.0), and the
data providers named on each station, under their own licences. The
integration shows the data provider and its licence with every station, as
the terms of Open Charge Map ask.

The test fixtures (test/fixtures/ocm-*.json) are stations around Luxembourg
City taken from the public export of Open Charge Map
(https://github.com/openchargemap/ocm-export), Open Charge Map Contributors,
CC BY 4.0.
